      "controls": {},
      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "A gear's Trigger fires an event on every whole cycle. The Master Gear is a beat, half a second: each Trigger fires an ADSR that kicks the kaleidoscope's zoom. A Ratio Gear at 1 : 4 is a bar, and its Trigger flashes the colour once every four beats. Turn the Master Gear's Length and both keep the beat; try the bar gear at 1 : 2."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
    },
